msgid "Static tenant configuration resolution"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When you set multiple tenant configurations in the `application.properties` "
"file, you only need to specify how the tenant identifier gets resolved.\n"
"To configure the resolution of the tenant identifier, use one of the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""

