"You can return the tenant id of either `a` or `b` from `io.quarkus.oidc."
"TenantResolver`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this example, the value of the last request path segment is a tenant id, "
"but if required, you can implement a more complex tenant identifier "
"resolution logic."
msgstr ""

msgid "Configure tenant paths"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can use the `quarkus.oidc.tenant-paths` configuration property for "
"resolving the tenant identifier as an alternative to using `io.quarkus.oidc."
"TenantResolver`.\n"
"Here is how you can select the `hr` tenant for the `sayHello` endpoint of "
"the `HelloResource` resource used in the previous example:"
msgstr ""

