"Same path-matching rules apply as for the `quarkus.http.auth.permission."
"authenticated.paths=/api/hello` configuration property from the previous "
"example."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The wildcard placed at the end of the path represents any number of path "
"segments. However the path is less specific than the `/api/hello`, therefore "
